  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "NEW LISTING! Nestled just one lot off the Gulf in Rosemary Beach, Sea Glass Cottage is a refined coastal retreat that seamlessly blends timeless charm with modern luxury. As you step inside, the first floor welcomes you with a sunlit living room and dining room great for gathering with family. A gourmet kitchen is a true showpiece equipped with appliances and exquisite finishes. Upstairs, three beautifully appointed bedrooms provide privacy and comfort. The master suite is a true coastal retreat with gulf views and private office space for remote work or quiet relaxation. The second bedroom offers balcony access with more stunning gulf views, queen bed, and bathroom. The third bedroom is a 4 bed bunk room. A cozy reading nook tucked along the hallway offers an additional peaceful retreat. From the moment you step onto the inviting front porch, the picturesque boardwalk guides you directly to the sugar-white sands and pristine Gulf waters. A leisurely stroll around brings you to the vibrant Town Center, where cobblestone streets are lined with charming boutiques, inviting cafés, and world-class dining. Four adult bikes are included with the stay in the biking community. Whether you're savoring a sunset along the shore, exploring the community’s signature architecture, or enjoying the neighborhood’s pools and green spaces, Sea Glass Cottage places you at the heart of it all. Consider this house your home away from home while you visit Rosemary Beach.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Sea Glass-Rosemary-steps to beach! Prime location, Private Beach/Pool Access"
